          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-11T02:26:52.409Z",
          "html": "<p>Done: a band inside a body has its round left end again. Each declaration is a section, which clipped the band where it was pulled left; now the section moves, not the band.</p>\n<epic-net-effect><ul><li>Every nested band, here and in the analysis page's mock-ups.</li></ul></epic-net-effect>"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
